  "description": "YITAMOTOR floor mats completely line the interior carpet to provide all-encompassing protection. We are confident that our products will surpass your expectations and make you a happy customer!\nFitment\n2015-2026 Ford Edge\nOnly fit carpet flooring.\nFor your safety, professional installation is highly recommended.\nFeatures\nCustom Fit: YITAMOTOR floor mats are precisely engineered to match the dimensions of the 2015-2026 Ford Edge SE/SEL/ST/Titanium/Sport/ST-Line; These mats offer edge-to-edge coverage for complete interior protection\nDurable Material: Crafted from high-performance TPE material, these floor mats for 2026 2025 Ford Edge meet recognized manufacturing standards; they are odorless, long-lasting, and designed to withstand cracking, deformation, or fading caused by extreme temperatures or frequent use.\nAll-Weather Protection: Designed with deep channels and raised edges, these all-weather floor liners effectively trap mud, snow, water, and debris; The anti-slip backing and built-in retention clips keep the mats securely in place, even in wet or slippery conditions\nEasy to Clean: The waterproof, skid-resistant surface makes cleaning effortless, just shake off dust, wipe with a cloth, or rinse with a hose; No need for harsh chemicals, making maintenance quick and convenient\nWhy Choose YITAMOTOR: Backed by advanced manufacturing and meticulous standards, YITAMOTOR floor mats deliver reliable, custom-fit protection year-round. For best results, please remove your previous mats before installation",
  "highlights": [
    "They securely attach to your vehicle using the original factory clasps, keeping the floor liners firmly in place and preventing unwanted shifting during daily driving.",
    "The raised edges provide maximum vehicle coverage, Floor Liners accurately and completely line the vehicle carpet giving absolute interior protection.",
    "Specially designed channels ensure the liner effectively contain the liquid to keep your vehicle and shoes clean, non-slip design for safe driving."
  ],
